.PP
Atoms (symbols) in LFE don\(cqt have property lists associated with
them.
However, here we have experimented with having a global ETS table
\f[CR]lfe\-symbol\-plist\f[R] which associates an atom with a property
list.
This is very unLFEy, but quite fun.
